<title>UK: MBNA prices 3.0 bln French franc asset-backed bond.</title>
<headline>MBNA prices 3.0 bln French franc asset-backed bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following asset-backed security, announced on Monday by lead manager J.P. Morgan has been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MBNA AMERICA EUROPEAN STRUCTURED OFFERINGS NO 2 LTD</p>
<p> AMT    3.0 BLN FFR   COUPON     5.625     EXP MAT     19.SEP.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.634    PAY DATE    07.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  32.5 BP   REOFFER    99.634    SPREAD	+23 BP</p>
